# ~/dotfiles/uwsm/.config/uwsm/env-hyprland
#
# UWSM's own convention: HYPR_*/AQ_* environment variables go here,
# separate from ~/.config/uwsm/env (theming/xcursor/toolkit variables —
# see themes/<name>/uwsm-env.sh, symlinked in as that file). Empty for
# now — nothing in this repo needs a Hyprland/Aquamarine-specific env
# var yet — but tracked anyway: without at least one real file, this
# directory wouldn't exist in a fresh clone at all (git doesn't track
# empty directories), and stow would have nothing to fold for the whole
# uwsm/ package, including the env file above that genuinely matters.
